  - m_Id: 38688428032
    m_Localized: 'Extra item damage now scales with a spell''s spell power. When
      hitting an enemy with >90% health remaining deal +{buff_0} damage.

      Enemies
      with <50% health remaining deal +{buff_1}% more damage!'
