  - m_Id: 105144252648034304
    m_Localized: Extra item damage now scales with a spell's spell power and you
      deal +{buff_0} damage to high health enemies. Low health enemies deal slightly
      more damage to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6789064481223999589
  - m_Id: 105144269077123072
    m_Localized: When painting I always started using this brush. It is so large
      that I could easily make a good base layer of paint.
